  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hurricane Fiona Response for Migrants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an emergency response for Hurricaine Fiona. The project contemplates the distribution of cash and its different derivatives such as vouchers. The possibility of delivering vouchers is subject to the migratory status of the families to be supported and the type of vulnerabilities to which they are exposed in the different provincial contexts. The delivery of cash provides an opportunity for communities and families in an irregular migratory situation to use these funds to respond to their particular needs.</narrative>
  </description>
